### Deedify API Test Requests
### Use this file with VS Code REST Client or JetBrains HTTP Client

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001
@contentType = application/json

### 1. Create a new order (PENDING)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "userId": "user_123",
  "listingId": "listing_456",
  "quantity": 10
}

### 2. Process fiat payment webhook (SUCCESS)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/fiat/webhook
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "orderId": "order_789",
  "status": "SUCCESS",
  "transactionHash": "tx_abc123"
}

### 3. Process fiat payment webhook (FAILED)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/fiat/webhook
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "orderId": "order_789",
  "status": "FAILED"
}

### 4. Get orders for a user
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/user/user_123

### 5. Get order by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/order_789

### 6. Health check (if implemented)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 7. Swagger documentation
GET {{baseUrl}}/api